---
import Command from "./Command.astro";
import Window from "./Window.astro";
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>Your agent's context comes in <span class="nowrap"><em>layers</em><span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      System prompt, built-in tools, MCP servers, instruction files, skills. Every turn carries all of
      them. Quench shows what is in each layer and what you can remove.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#install">[ Install ]</a>
      <Command text="quench" />
    </div>
    <p class="facts">[X] Read-only &nbsp; [X] Local &nbsp; [X] Claude Code, Codex, Pi</p>
  </div>
  <Window />
</section>
